url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfl.jpg"}, {"id": 1068466, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfm.jpg"}, {"id": 1068467, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfn.jpg"}, {"id": 1068468, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfo.jpg"}, {"id": 1068469, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfp.jpg"}, {"id": 1068470, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfq.jpg"}, {"id": 1068471, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfr.jpg"}, {"id": 1068472, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwfs.jpg"}, {"id": 1068473, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scmwft.jpg"}], "slug": "the-guardian-of-nature", "storyline": "\u00abThe Guardian of Nature\u00bb is a wholesome puzzle adventure game about the interconnectedness of nature, created in a wonderful hand-drawn and hand-animation style. You play as Henry, the last Guardian of Nature who needs to go on a magical journey to save nature and The Tree of Life.\n\nThe key features of the game are:\n\nChange size to explore nature large and small.\nExplore environments above and below ground.\nFind and use inventory items.\nFind out how nature is interconnected and fill up the Book of Nature with discoveries you make along the way.\n\nSolve nature-inspired and solarpunk puzzles and learn about the intricate inventions of the the Guardians.\n\ufe0fA wonderful blend of wholesome experience and a modern twist on point-and-click adventures. Cozy gamers and old-school adventure gamers will feel right at home!", "summary": "\"The Guardian of Nature\" is a hand-drawn, size-changing adventure. Embark on a magical journey with botanist Henry, use your size-changing ability to explore nature in big and small and solve solarpunk puzzles to put nature back in order.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/the-guardian-of-nature", "videos": [{"id": 91619, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "yJUHcbSDww